::浮いている敵に強い超激レアキャラクターが集結！ 新レアガチャシリーズ「エアバスターズ」登場！
::''(Uber Rare Cats that strong against Floating enemies have gathered! New Gacha series "Air Busters" appear!)''
'''AIR BUSTERS''' (エアバスターズ ''Eabasutāzu'') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event contains [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] Uber Rare Cats from other events. This event was added on September 16th, 2016 in [[Nyanko Daisensou]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

